@startuml
skinparam backgroundStyle white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title Sequence Diagram — Alur Dokumen PPID (URL Tersembunyi + Cache Panas)

actor Pengunjung as U
participant "Browser" as B
participant "Halaman PPID\nforce-dynamic" as HP
participant "getPPIDItems()\nsrc/services/api.ts" as API
participant "globalThis.__ppidCache\nfresh 2 menit" as CH
participant "/api/ppid/stream" as ST
participant "Portal PPID\nppid.provcontoh.go.id" as PP
participant "instrumentation-node.ts\ninterval 60 detik" as W

W -> CH: warm() kategori 1, 2, 3, 6 saat start
loop setiap 60 detik
  W -> CH: segarkan seluruh entri cache
end

activate U
U -> B: buka /ppid/data-informasi
activate B
B -> HP: GET /ppid/data-informasi
activate HP
HP -> API: getPPIDItems(id_category=2)
activate API
API -> CH: cek entri cache
activate CH

alt entri segar (usia < 2 menit)
  CH --> API: data lama langsung
  note right of CH: stale-while-revalidate: pengunjung
  note right of CH  : tidak menunggu 9 MB / 20 detik
else entri basi (usia >= 2 menit)
  CH --> API: data lama + pemicu refresh latar belakang
  API -> PP: GET /api/cluster-data?id_instansi=86&id_category=2
  PP --> API: 50 item JSON (retry 3x, timeout 90 detik)
  API -> CH: perbarui timestamp
else tanpa entri
  CH --> API: kosong
  API -> PP: tunggu unduhan penuh (inflight dedup)
  PP --> API: 50 item JSON
  API -> CH: simpan entri
end
deactivate CH
API --> HP: PPIDItem[]
deactivate API
HP -> HP: transformPPIDItem() → /api/ppid/stream?id=&t=&n=
HP --> B: HTML daftar dokumen
deactivate HP

U -> B: klik unduh dokumen
B -> ST: GET /api/ppid/stream?id=..&t=TOKEN&n=judul
activate ST
ST -> PP: ikuti redirect maksimum 5 + DNS publik
PP --> ST: stream biner PDF/gambar
ST --> B: konten + Cache-Control private max-age=300
deactivate ST
note over ST,PP: URL asli portal PPID tidak pernah sampai ke browser
B --> U: dokumen terbuka/terunduh
deactivate B
deactivate U

@enduml
